  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Add the water to a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• Add the plant-based butter and stir to combine.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-31094200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, trim and roughly chop pea pods.\n• Thinly slice capsicum into strips.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into quarters.\n• In a small bowl, combine plant-based Asian mushroom sauce, the brown sugar, vinegar, soy sauce and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-6148c610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook capsicum and pea pods, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-bd7e8920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-135ae230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to low. To the pan with tofu, add the sauce mixture and return the veggies to the pan.\n• Add Asian greens and toss until wilted and combined, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-e70ea240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice and Japanese tofu and pea pod stir-fry between bowls.\n• Top stir-fry with spring onion and sesame seeds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-aabde050.jpg"
    }
  ]
